<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Elec final '96 net down sharply.</title>
<headline>Samsung Elec final '96 net down sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31,1996.</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   1,784    vs 39,180</p>
<p>    Net					     164.16 vs  2,505.48</p>
<p>Div in cash (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	common shares				12    vs     20</p>
<p>	preferred shares			   13    vs     21</p>
<p>Div in stocks (pct)</p>
<p>	common shares			     none   vs	3</p>
<p>	preferred shares			  none   vs	3</p>
<p>    Turnover				   15,874.54 vs 16,189.84</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   208.52 vs  3,006.51</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)		15.11 vs     29.34</p>
<p>NOTE - Samsung Electronics Co is the flagship unit of the computer memory chips. It said profits fell sharply due to a plunge in the prices of dynamic random access memory chips. The final figures were in line with provisional figures given on Thursday by a company official.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
